s  and when it comes to making the most of  your visits there are certainly things  you can do to ensure  that your visits go smoothly here's my  checkup checklist  first review your family health history  ahead of your appointment  have your close relatives experienced  any new conditions or diseases since  your last visit  second write down a list of issues and  questions to take with you  have you noticed any body changes pain  or fatigue  have your eating or sleeping habits  changed are you taking your medications  as directed  be honest with yourself and your primary  care provider  and finally when you're at your  appointment discuss your future  review any scheduled treatments for  recent lifestyle changes  so you can help make more informed  decisions about your health care plan  write down notes so you can keep your  doctor's advice at hand once you get  back home  and if you do these things you're likely  not only impressed your provider  you may improve your likelihood of  getting the care that best meets your  needs  wow  i know right thank you thank you rachel  and sarah for you  any last words for our viewers that want  to know more about humana and just  how to take care of themselves overall  i'll add this at humana we not only care  for our medicare advantage members we  care about them too  this is the heart of our whole person  health care philosophy  and value-based care model that many of  our network providers participate in  primary care providers with the  value-based care arrangement  in our network are rewarded for care  that leads to better health and a better  experience for our patients  not just the number of patients they see  and the procedures they  order give humana a call at  1-800-345-8017 or  visit them online at healthfatcares.com
 

